    "preference_value": "When the question asks for \"standard deviation of the anomaly score\" in the context of TOLS/alien signal analysis, it means the population variance formula AVG(AnomScore²) − AVG(AnomScore)², NOT the square root of variance. Do not apply SQRT(). This convention was validated against the reference answer for alien_2 (TOLS Category signal statistics).",
