    "preference_type": "data_table",
    "preference_value": "When the target database is SQLite and the task requires median/percentile computation, use the lower-median approach: compute (total_count + 1) / 2 with integer division to select a single row position, not the average of two middle values. This matches SQLite's integer division behavior where (N+1)/2 for even N gives N/2 (the lower of the two middle positions). Apply this unless the user explicitly asks for interpolated median.",
